{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02817","headline":"绵州官池赠别同赋湾字 · 卢照邻","name":"绵州官池赠别同赋湾字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"輶轩遵上国，仙佩下灵关。\n尊酒方无地，联绻喜暂攀。\n离言欲赠策，高辨正连环。\n野迳浮云断，荒池春草斑。\n残花落古树，度鸟入澄湾。\n欲敍他乡别，幽谷有绵蛮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02817.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02817","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}